1
00:00:01,401 --> 00:00:02,401
You're here.

2
00:00:03,069 --> 00:00:03,937
Where's the boss?

3
00:00:03,937 --> 00:00:04,871
He's out on business.

4
00:00:04,871 --> 00:00:07,173
- Pretty, right?
- Not really.

5
00:00:09,743 --> 00:00:11,444
You are a flower yourself.

6
00:00:11,711 --> 00:00:13,646
How can I ever lay eyes
on other ones?

7
00:00:13,646 --> 00:00:14,814
Oh, you!

8
00:00:15,782 --> 00:00:16,583
Sweetie.

9
00:00:16,583 --> 00:00:17,584
Who is that woman?

10
00:00:18,251 --> 00:00:19,251
Sweetie?

11
00:00:19,953 --> 00:00:21,154
I can explain all of this.

12
00:00:21,421 --> 00:00:23,089
There's no need for that.

13
00:00:23,423 --> 00:00:24,724
I'm going to kill you.

14
00:00:24,924 --> 00:00:25,925
And this flower shop!

15
00:00:26,793 --> 00:00:29,763
Everyone! A cheater is
working at this flower shop!

16
00:00:30,663 --> 00:00:32,265
For now, it's just
an imagination.

17
00:00:32,265 --> 00:00:33,985
But God knows when
it will become a reality.

18
00:00:34,200 --> 00:00:37,203
Hye-won is fine, but I can't
be sure about Eun-ho.

19
00:00:37,470 --> 00:00:39,572
I've got to check when
the two of them are alone.

20
00:00:41,207 --> 00:00:42,275
Strange...

21
00:00:42,275 --> 00:00:43,275
They're only working.

22
00:00:49,349 --> 00:00:52,352
Maybe I was overreacting.

23
00:00:52,685 --> 00:00:54,354
I might've jumped
to conclusions

24
00:00:54,354 --> 00:00:56,790
and misunderstood their
honest friendship?

25
00:00:57,590 --> 00:00:59,159
Now I'm starting
to feel guilty.

26
00:01:01,561 --> 00:01:03,163
I'd better bring
some snacks for them.

27
00:01:09,803 --> 00:01:10,803
What are you guys doing?

28
00:01:12,639 --> 00:01:14,541
Oh, I see.

29
00:01:14,541 --> 00:01:16,443
That was a bit misleading.

30
00:01:17,110 --> 00:01:18,945
I just remembered
I have something to do.

31
00:01:20,080 --> 00:01:21,080
Ow!

32
00:01:21,214 --> 00:01:22,382
Hye-won!

33
00:01:22,615 --> 00:01:24,884
Hye-won?

34
00:01:25,718 --> 00:01:27,720
I can't let this happen.

35
00:01:27,720 --> 00:01:29,255
How dare they...
